md=['# Macroeconomics faculty candidate closure — October 6, 2026','','**FINAL STATUS: PASS. All 30 faculty decisions are closed. Remaining faculty decisions: 0.**','','## Executive summary','','Implemented the supplied closure prompt and reconciled it against all 30 populated decision rows in the completed workbook. The explicit closure prompt controlled where workbook notes were conditional. The accepted broad Macro review was not repeated. Changed 27 candidate records and 15 explicitly named Macro-only family dependencies (42 total). Three candidates were retained exactly as directed. All 20 accepted changes from the earlier October 6 pass remain exact. Canonical totals remain 9,777 overall, 4,747 Macro, 6,297 Micro and 1,589 General. No IDs were added, deleted or renamed.','','## All 30 dispositions','','| Review | Question ID | Final disposition |','| --- | --- | --- |']
